        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, eshialo shiabaKalidayo; oluyia luno shiluliho khandi ta; omuAshuru yashireeleho khulwa tsisolo etsiomushitsiimi; basinjisia ebirandaalo biabwe, nibakwisia tsinzu tsialio tsikhuIundu; yalikhola amayindi.",
          "type": "text",
