              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne munduukho eyo Tiro liliibililwa emiyika amakhumi musaafu, shinga tsindaalo tsiomuruchi mulala; nolunyuma Iwemiyika amakhumi musaafu, kalikwila Tiro shinga akomulwimbo Iwomutamba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.15"
            ]
