          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olunyuma Iwemiyika amakhumi musaafu OMWAMI alikoonya Tiro, nalio lilikalushila emirungo chialio, ne lilikhola obutamba nende obwami bwosi bwomushialo, obuli mubibala biosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne inganga yalio nende emirungo chialio biliahulilwa OMWAMI; shibilibiikhwa kata okhukhung'aasibwa ta; okhuba inganga yalio yiliba khulwabo abamenyanga imbeli wOMWAMI, mbu balie nibeekura, khandi khulwa tsingubo tsindayi muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
